### API Contracts

#### 1. `POST /api/v1/experiences`
- **Auth**: Required
- **Request**:
  ```json
  {
    "title": "Failed my first semester in engineering",
    "story": "During my first year, I struggled with calculus...",
    "category_id": "a3b8d4e2-9f1c-4b5a-8e2d-3c4b5a6f7e8d",
    "tags": ["college", "failure", "resilience"],
    "status": "active"
  }
  ```
- **Response (`201 Created`)**:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": "f8a12b34-5678-49ab-9012-3456789abcde",
      "title": "Failed my first semester in engineering",
      "status": "active",
      "created_at": "2026-08-31T17:00:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```

#### 2. `GET /api/v1/experiences`
- **Auth**: Public
- **Query Params**: `page=1`, `limit=10`, `category=education`, `tag=college`, `sort=latest|outcomes`
- **Response (`200 OK`)**:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f8a12b34-5678-49ab-9012-3456789abcde",
          "title": "Failed my first semester in engineering",
          "story_preview": "During my first year, I struggled with calculus and time management...",
          "author": { "id": "uuid", "username": "PhoenixRiser", "avatar_url": null },
          "category": { "id": "uuid", "name": "Education", "slug": "education" },
          "tags": ["college", "failure"],
          "outcomes_count": 2,
          "comments_count": 5,
          "is_bookmarked": false,
          "created_at": "2026-08-31T17:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "pagination": { "page": 1, "limit": 10, "total": 28, "total_pages": 3 }
    }
  }
  ```

#### 3. `POST /api/v1/bookmarks`
- **Auth**: Required
- **Request**: `{ "experience_id": "f8a12b34-5678-49ab-9012-3456789abcde" }`
- **Response (`200 OK`)**:
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "experience_id": "f8a12b34-5678-49ab-9012-3456789abcde",
      "bookmarked": true
    }
  }
  ```

